# HP50g ARMToolbox install using x49gp's HPGCC2 semantics.
# Keep integer port 2 on the stack, recall SETUP.BIN from SD, HALT the
# File Manager back to the stack, EVAL the recalled installer, warmstart,
# then verify library 275 in port 2.
2000 tap f6
4000 tap f6
5000 tap mode
5500 tap neg
6000 tap f6
6500 tap two
6800 tap enter
7600 capture port-number
8200 chord lshift files
10400 capture files
10700 tap up
11000 tap f6
12700 capture sd
13200 tap enter
13600 tap down
14300 capture sd-setup
14700 tap f4
16000 capture recalled-in-filer
16400 tap nxt
16800 tap nxt
17600 capture filer-halt-menu
18000 tap f1
19300 capture recalled-stack
19800 tap eval
21500 capture setup-evaluated
22500 chord on f3
24500 capture warmstart
25000 chord rshift two
26200 capture lib
26600 tap f3
27900 capture port2
28300 tap f4
29600 capture armtoolbox
30000 finish-install
